Package: command
Type: Package
Title: Process Command Line Arguments
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "John",
           family = "Bryant",
	   email = "john@bayesiandemography.com",
	   role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Bayesian Demography Limited",
            role = "cph"))
Description: Process command line arguments. Processing
    includes checking, naming, and coercing to numeric,
    date, or logical. By capturing assumptions about
    inputs and outputs, the 'command' package can
    provide scripts with well defined interfaces,
    leading to safer, more modular data analysis pipelines.
